  "Specification": "Abstract TLA+ model of the TCP finite state machine from RFC 9293. Models user commands (PASSIVE_OPEN, ACTIVE_OPEN, CLOSE_*, SEND), the system-side per-state transitions (SynSent, SynReceived, Listen, Established, FinWait1/2, Closing, LastAck, TimeWait, Note2), and reset behavior; checks an ESTABLISHED-symmetry invariant and a SYN-SENT leads-to property under weak fairness.",
